    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Murphy Mullan are delighted to present this rare opportunity to acquire this residential building with two apartments in the historic, heart of Dublin City.  Ideally suited to an investor.\r\n\r\nApartment 1: A two bedroomed ground floor apartment.\r\n\r\nApartment 2:  A one bedroomed, first floor apartment with roof top garden.\r\n\r\nThe building is fully compliant with Planning and Building Regulations.\r\n\r\nNo 26 the Coombe is within walking distance to St Stephens Green & Grafton Street area.  Both the Red and Green Luas lines are within walking distance providing easy access to most areas in Dublin city.  There are a host of amenities on your doorstep with the cultural area of Meath Street, Frances Street & Thomas Street all close by.  The opportunities to explore all Dublin city has to offer is unparalleled.\r\n\r\nApartment 1: Well-laid-out Ground Floor accommodation briefly comprises a living room, kitchen, two double bedrooms, and one bathroom. The apartment also boasts a small rear yard suitable for securely storing bikes and bins. \r\n\r\nApartment 2:  Well laid out First Floor accommodation briefly comprises of living/kitchen area, one double bedroom plus one bathroom.  This apartment also boasts a suntrap rooftop garden, with ample space to securely store bikes & bins. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor Apartment\r\n(Two Bed)\r\n\r\nLiving Room: Laminate Flooring\r\nKitchen: An array of kitchen presses and units, laminate flooring\r\nBedroom 1: Double bedroom, solid wood flooring\r\nBedroom 2: Double bedroom, solid wood flooring\r\nBathroom: Wash hand basin, WC, Step in electric shower unit\r\n\r\nTOP FLOOR APARTMENT\r\n(One Bed)\r\n\r\nLiving/kitchen area: An array of kitchen units.  Laminate flooring\r\nBedroom: Double bedroom\r\nBathroom: Wash hand basin, WC, Step in shower unit\r\nRooftop Garden: Suntraps roof top garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "LOCATION! LOCATION! LOCATION!\r\nTwo Apartments – One ground floor two bed apartment & one first floor one-bedroom apartment with roof top garden\r\nThe building is fully compliant with Planning and Building Regulations.\r\nIn the Heart of Old Historic Dublin\r\nWithin Walking Distance to Stephen Green\r\nWithin Walking Distance to both Green & Red Luas Lines\r\nHost of amenities on your doorstep\r\nDouble Glazed Windows \r\nElectric Storage Heaters-Ground Floor Apartment\r\nGas fired Storage Heaters- First Floor Apartment\r\nHost of amenities within walking distance"
      },
      {
